ンスよく出演してたかな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも個人的には2日目！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も、去年と同じくらいにそれ以上に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のびのび生き生き頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/06/28/6070513/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/06/28/6070513/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/06/28/6070513/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Thierry Colson"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人工海岸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/06/28/6070513/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃらん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://www.jp.playstation.com/blog/detail/5215/20170626-gd2.html?tkgpscom=dc_gd2_fb_20170626"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「カンヌライオンズ 2017｣で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『GRAVITY DAZE 2』の｢重力猫｣PVが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"Gold Lion\"他7つの賞を受賞！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"✨✨✨✨✨✨✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7つも！ゴールドも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やなしょー2年連続ゴールド！！なんと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフの皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当におめでとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして素敵な機会を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢広がる〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私まで幸せな気持ち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#重力猫『GRAVITY CAT / 重力的眩暈子猫編』presented by GRAVITY DAZE 2"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://youtu.be/0lQMXyNUmDs"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#重力猫『The Making of GRAVITY CAT - Behind the Scenes - 』 presented by GRAVITY DAZE 2"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://youtu.be/WtwrnAvNBL4"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-32599":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服と髪型を\nお留守番チームさんに報告o(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部 サイド三つ編み"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/06/04/5122558/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月刊エンタメさんで着てた\nおっきいTシャツだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下履いてる？って\nいっぱい言われた(｀・ω・´)\nあとスニーカー珍しいねって言われた～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部 巻き下ろし\n3部 バニラスペシャル(ハタチ風)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/06/04/5122558/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見えないですがイヤリングしてます\nまりっかめらまんが撮ってくれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華ちゃんから頂いたトップス\nいっぱい褒めてもらった＼(^o^)／\nANN0で着てたお洋服です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部 ツインテール\n5部 ポニーテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/06/04/5122558/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱツインテールには\n一定数需要があるみたいなので\nこれからも毎回どこかの部でやる予定です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、ナース着ないの？って\nめっちゃ言われた( >_< )\nごめんなさい気が利かなくて( >_< )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまいまいの卒業セレモニーに\n参加してきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/06/04/5122558/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなお揃いのTシャツで\nまいまいを見届けたよ( ˇωˇ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"最後の\"って言葉がつく度に\nどんどん実感が湧いてきます......\n卒業公演、絶対素敵なものにするからね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで\n今日は14th最後の個別握手会でしたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回から30部に増えて\n夢が叶ったぞ～ってワクワクと\n少しの不安とともにスタートしましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん新しい出会いがあったり\n今まで以上に深い話が聞けたり\nひとりひとりとの距離が\nさらに近くなれたような気が勝手にしてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口下手だったり不器用なところがあるので\nどうしたらもっと楽しんで貰えるんだろうと\n悩んだ時期もありましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、純粋に、心から楽しかった！\n今までのシングルで一番楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオ、テレビ、雑誌など\n前と比べて話のトピックが増えたことも\n幸せだな～と感謝をしつつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何よりたくさんの方が足を運んで下さり\nたくさんパワーを頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しい時間でした\n会いに来て下さった皆さん\n本当にありがとうございました( ˇωˇ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜の夜は、らじらー！サンデー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のゲストは\n声優アーツに村川梨衣さん\n乃木坂から松村沙友理ちゃんが登場！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"募集中のメールテーマは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◯まっちゅんへの応援メッセージ\n◯RAPで教えてNOGIZAKA CHAN\n◯擬音でドッカーン対決！\n◯オリひめトークセッション"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもふつおた、リクエストソング、\nレギュラーコーナーへの投稿\nお待ちしてます( ˆωˆ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宛先はこちら\nhttp://www.nhk.or.jp/radirer/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/06/04/5122558/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まちゅん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そういえば\n全国の学校にらじらー！ポスター\n届いてるみたい(^o^)報告ありがと～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～お知らせ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6/6 TopYell\n6/10 マーキー\n6/15 EX大衆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}}